  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To support the Government of Montserrat in its delivery of essential services for the citizens of Montserrat through the provision of essential equipment and small capital items.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity To support the Government of Montserrat in its delivery of essential services for the citizens of Montserrat through the provision of essential equipment and small capital items. is a component of Montserrat Financial Aid 2016/17 - 2018/19 reported by FCDO with a funding type of 108 - Non-budget support financial aid and a budget of &#xa3;958,389. It works in the following sector(s): Public sector policy and administrative management, Information and communication technology (ICT), Road transport, Disaster prevention and preparedness, Electric power transmission and distribution (centralised grids).</narrative>
  </description>
